        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Panopticon is a mystery adventure set in the daily routine in a café.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by Unreal Engine and Meta Human, the realistic game environment immerses the player as a barista, uncovering the secrets hidden within the café.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What truth lies behind the boss’s surveillance and the red door?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505600/extras/435ee130a074aa9f23c067c9f77bb39d.poster.avif?t=1787468483\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505600/extras/435ee130a074aa9f23c067c9f77bb39d.webm?t=1787468483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505600/extras/435ee130a074aa9f23c067c9f77bb39d.mp4?t=1787468483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Café Tasks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew coffee like a real barista, interact with customers, and experience daily café life through diverse key inputs and quick-time events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505600/extras/792be2512ff9c361a5a4b54edcd7057c.poster.avif?t=1787468483\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505600/extras/792be2512ff9c361a5a4b54edcd7057c.webm?t=1787468483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505600/extras/792be2512ff9c361a5a4b54edcd7057c.mp4?t=1787468483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Story with Cinematic Presentation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a story with escalating tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conversations between high-resolution Meta Human characters deliver an experience like watching a short film.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※ Some of the scenes include jump scares.</p>",
